  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.28 Single-ply roof membrane",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.28 “Single-ply roof membrane” means a prefabricated single sheet of rubber, normally ethylene-propylenediene terpolymer, that is field-applied to a building roof using one layer of membrane material. The term does not include membranes prefabricated from EPDM.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
